{"resource":{"id":"rust-reference-guide","title":"Rust — Reference Guide","category":"Programming","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"41 min","pages":51,"lastUpdated":"July 2026","tags":["Programming","Rust","Systems"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555949963-aa79dcee981c?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"Daily-use Rust reference — syntax, std library, Cargo commands, collections, smart pointers, traits, generics, async, macros, testing, networking, and deployment lookup tables."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"s1","label":"1. Syntax Reference"},{"id":"s2","label":"2. Standard Library"},{"id":"s3","label":"3. Cargo Commands"},{"id":"s4","label":"4. Modules & Visibility"},{"id":"s5","label":"5. Collections"},{"id":"s6","label":"6. Smart Pointers"},{"id":"s7","label":"7. Traits & Generics"},{"id":"s8","label":"8. Async Programming"},{"id":"s9","label":"9. Macros"},{"id":"s10","label":"10. Testing"},{"id":"s11","label":"11. Networking"},{"id":"s12","label":"12. Deployment"},{"id":"diagrams","label":"Architecture Diagrams"},{"id":"best","label":"Best Practices"},{"id":"mistakes","label":"Common Mistakes"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Rust — Cheat Sheet","tag":"Programming","time":"12 min"},{"title":"Rust — Glossary","tag":"Programming","time":"15 min"},{"title":"Rust — Advanced Concepts","tag":"Programming","time":"31 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>One page to keep open all day.</li>\n          <li>Fast recall of syntax, commands, and idioms.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Syntax Reference</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse\"><tbody>\n          <Row k=\"let x = 5;\" v=\"Immutable binding\" />\n          <Row k=\"let mut x = 5;\" v=\"Mutable binding\" />\n          <Row k=\"const N: u32 = 10;\" v=\"Compile-time constant\" />\n          <Row k=\"fn add(a:i32, b:i32) -> i32\" v=\"Function signature\" />\n          <Row k=\"match e { A => 1, _ => 0 }\" v=\"Exhaustive pattern match\" />\n        </tbody></table>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517694712202-14dd9538aa97?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — The essentials fit on a single screen.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Standard Library</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse\"><tbody>\n          <Row k=\"Option<T>\" v=\"Some/None wrapper\" />\n          <Row k=\"Result<T,E>\" v=\"Ok/Err wrapper\" />\n          <Row k=\"Vec<T>\" v=\"Growable array\" />\n          <Row k=\"HashMap<K,V>\" v=\"Hashed key/value map\" />\n          <Row k=\"String\" v=\"Owned UTF-8 string\" />\n        </tbody></table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Cargo Commands</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>cargo new my-app\ncargo build [--release]\ncargo run\ncargo test\ncargo fmt\ncargo clippy -- -D warnings\ncargo add serde --features derive\ncargo publish</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Modules &amp; Visibility</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>mod utils {\n    pub fn hi() {}\n    pub(crate) fn only_here() {}\n}\nuse utils::hi;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Collections</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse\"><tbody>\n          <Row k=\"Vec::new()\" v=\"Empty vector\" />\n          <Row k=\"Vec::with_capacity(n)\" v=\"Preallocated\" />\n          <Row k=\"HashMap::new()\" v=\"Empty map\" />\n          <Row k=\"BTreeMap::new()\" v=\"Sorted map\" />\n        </tbody></table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Smart Pointers</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse\"><tbody>\n          <Row k=\"Box<T>\" v=\"Heap allocation\" />\n          <Row k=\"Rc<T>\" v=\"Single-threaded refcount\" />\n          <Row k=\"Arc<T>\" v=\"Atomic refcount\" />\n          <Row k=\"RefCell<T>\" v=\"Interior mutability (runtime-checked)\" />\n        </tbody></table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Traits &amp; Generics</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>fn max&lt;T: PartialOrd&gt;(a:T, b:T) -&gt; T { if a&gt;b {a} else {b} }\ntrait Greet { fn hi(&amp;self); }\nimpl Greet for &amp;str { fn hi(&amp;self){ println!(&quot;hi {self}&quot;); } }</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Async Programming</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>#[tokio::main]\nasync fn main() -&gt; anyhow::Result&lt;()&gt; {\n    let body = reqwest::get(&quot;https://example.com&quot;).await?.text().await?;\n    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, body.len());\n    Ok(())\n}</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s9\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Macros</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>macro_rules! square { ($x:expr) =&gt; { $x * $x }; }\nlet s = square!(4); // 16</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s10\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Testing</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>#[cfg(test)]\nmod tests {\n    #[test]\n    fn works() { assert_eq!(2+2, 4); }\n}</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s11\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">11. Networking</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>HTTP: <code>reqwest</code>, <code>hyper</code>, <code>axum</code>. TCP: <code>tokio::net::TcpListener</code>. gRPC: <code>tonic</code>.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — Ecosystem cheat-map for network stacks.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s12\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">12. Deployment</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>FROM rust:1.80 AS builder\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY . .\nRUN cargo build --release\nFROM gcr.io/distroless/cc\nCOPY --from=builder /app/target/release/app /\nCMD [&quot;/app&quot;]</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"diagrams\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Architecture Diagrams</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>source → cargo → rustc → linker → binary\n                            ↓\n                         (LTO/PGO)</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"best\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Best Practices</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Keep clippy strict in CI.</li>\n          <li>Prefer async when I/O-bound, threads when CPU-bound.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"mistakes\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Common Mistakes</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Blocking calls inside async runtimes.</li>\n          <li>Forgetting <code>--release</code> for benchmarks.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/><path d=\"M10 22h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Tip</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">Bookmark this page — it's the fastest way to remember syntax.</div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Rust rewards recall. Skim daily, drill weekly, ship monthly.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Which Rust edition should I use?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Latest stable (2024 or newer).</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Reference is snapshot-in-time; verify against current toolchain.</p>\n      </div></section>"}